Gaster was modified by Mineek to include support for booting PongoOS
payloads, by sending the device into download mode with extracted
stage2 payloads from Checkra1n.

libOpenra1n
Copyright (c) 2026 palera1n team

Openra1n was modified into a importable library for use in palera1n,
(libOpenra1n) along side another checkm8 backend (closed source).

Many changes included are mainly for overall better practices and
readability, like better error handling. Other changes include
more verbose logging, fixes for libusb/iokit, and a ROP generator.
